      "claim": "John Key is a New Zealand citizen and former Prime Minister of New Zealand, not a U.S. government official.",
      "evidence": "Biographical records (e.g., New Zealand Parliament archives, reputable news sources) list John Key’s nationality as New Zealand and his political career solely in New Zealand.",
